            "review_title": "Review at Halo Saigon - Vietnamese Cuisine & Vegan Food",
            "review_text": "Heinz Henry Jr\nMandaluyong, Philippines31 contributions\n0\nHalo Saigon - Two Thumbs Up\nOct 2026 • Family\nWe highly recommend Halo Saigon. It is located near Ly Tu Trung Phuong in District 1, very accessible especially to those who booked a hotel in the area. The food is great, it has a good ambiance, and the staff are very accommodating It's owner is actually lucky because the staff would proactively go out to assist customers right away assuring them of a great service. It is also important to take note that the staff can speak understandable English. We will definitely go back to dine there again.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nNo cash? They accept card payment.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 1, 2026",
